Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:06.67,Title,0,0,0,0,,[歌曲：唐·特里的《膝盖颤抖》]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[song: 'Knees Shakin' by Don Terry]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪我望着高山，高山开始摇晃♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ And I looked at a mountain and the mountain started shakin'♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.99,0:00:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪我望着巨岩，巨岩开始碎裂♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I looked at a boulder and the boulder started breakin' ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪我望着地面，地面开始摇晃♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I looked at the ground and the ground started shakin' ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.65,0:00:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪我望着你，我的膝盖开始颤抖♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ When I looked at you my knees started shakin' ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:28.36,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\rc\fs25\shad2\1c&HFFFFFF&\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}《地狱男爵：歪曲人》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\rc\fs25\shad2\1c&HFFFFFF&\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}（1959年）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔，你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe, you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，听到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为大红不怕任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Big Red wasn't scared of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是毛骨悚然了，朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You getting the heebie-jeebies, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是毛骨悚然本身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the heebie-jeebies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒我一下，为什么初级特工要跟着来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me why Junior G-man's coming along for a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来确保箱子里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just here to make sure that whatever's in that box.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.09,0:01:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一位美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one pretty lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.65,0:01:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,能安全地再走600英里到费尔菲尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}make another 600 miles to, Fairfield without any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么箱子里是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's in the box?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该告诉他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.07,0:01:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只漏斗网蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}A funnel-web spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是世界上最致命的蛛形纲动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably the most deadly arachnid in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.29,0:01:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过这只似乎寄宿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only this one seems to house a plausibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个疑似恶魔的实体\N{\fnArial\fs30}demonic entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.38,0:01:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在开玩笑吧，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're yanking my chain, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不是全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,与这个生物相关的还有各种奇怪的现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's all manner of bizarre phenomena associated with this creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间的、引力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temporal, gravitational.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你难以置信的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean things you wouldn't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎不敢相信，而我已经详细\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely believe it and I've cataloged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.83,0:02:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录了照片证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}the photographic evidence in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一直被保持镇静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been kept sedated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,处于感官剥夺状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a state of sensory deprivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.31,0:02:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们能在更受控的环境中分析它\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we can analyze it in a more controlled setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死，你真的没听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dammit, you're not hearing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.75,0:02:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵，你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.41,0:02:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:23.93,Title,0,0,0,0,,[歌曲：唐·特里的《膝盖颤抖》继续]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[song: 'Knees Shakin" by Don Terry continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.64,0:02:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 心在痛 骨头在碎 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Heart achin' bones a Breakin' ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我爱上了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I'm in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.09,0:03:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 是的，没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You alright? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，装死一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, lay dead a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Oh fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵，地狱男爵，看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy, Hellboy, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更喜欢它们小一点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like them better small.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.92,0:04:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让它逃跑，别让它逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him get away, Don't let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会在树林中间建一条通往地狱的隧道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who builds a tunnel to hell in the middle of the woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种通风井\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of ventilation shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:04:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,煤矿区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coal mining country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿巴拉契亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appalachia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.49,0:05:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧太棒了，我们丢了货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that's just swell, we lost the cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.93,0:05:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, he, he.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,实地工作，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Field work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟研究工作不太一样，是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not much like research, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.27,0:05:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛是什么让它变得如此疯狂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider what made it go crazy like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些山里有些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in these hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,树木，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有泥土\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种闹鬼的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方有一股臭味\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place has the stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到松针的味道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smell pine needles?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之下，乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Underneath that, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.99,0:06:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼唤着蜘蛛爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}called out to Daddy Longlegs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,唤醒了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woke him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.31,0:06:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.09,0:06:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗的东西会呼唤黑暗的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark things call to dark things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真是完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,完蛋、玩完、一败涂地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screwed, chewed, and tattooed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要，我们需要找个电话 我们得报告这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need, we need to find a phone We need to call this in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.48,0:07:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这附近我不确定我们俩谁更引人注目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around these parts I'm not sure which one of us stands out more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是魔鬼沿路上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the devil come up the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No it ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.40,0:07:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.23,0:07:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是联合国那个红色家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that red fella from the United Nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:23.49,Title,0,0,0,0,,我曾在《生活》杂志封面上见过他一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen him once on the cover of Life magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,联合国？\N{\fnArial\fs30}United Nations?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,小东方娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}little oriental doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真是个漂亮的小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't you a purdy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是宋特工，女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Special Agent Song, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.73,0:07:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出了车祸，请问你们有电话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been in an accident; do you happen to have a phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.69,0:07:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在后面，彩电旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in back next to the color television.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那只会拉银元的鸡旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the chicken that shits out silver dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有奔驰车旁边 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and the Mercedes Benz - Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}May as well come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人，给他们些现代衣服穿，亲爱的，他们的衣服都破了，还沾满了血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, get these on some modern rags, doll, they're all cut up and bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦不，不用麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no, that's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我发现他，他就一动不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't moved a muscle since I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想过带他去看医生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone thought of taking him to the doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这儿有医生吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys have doctors, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还是你们喜欢他当地毯？ - 卡车坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or you like him as a rug? - Truck's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说了，医生也帮不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhow ain't no doctor gonna do him no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 因为他中了巫术，就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why's that? - Cause he witched, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.73,0:08:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫术？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witched?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子没脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Child didn't have no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.48,0:08:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直捉弄科拉·费舍尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kept teasing that Cora Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝她窗户扔石头，留下死东西让她发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throwing rocks at her window, leaving dead things for her to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他离她远点，大家都知道科拉·费舍尔是个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told him he better stay away from her, Everyone knows Cora Fisher be a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说科拉·费舍尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said Cora Fisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·法雷尔，我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom Ferrell I will be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.97,0:08:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到还能在这儿见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never thought we'd see you around these parts again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆，多少年了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many years it been, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有段时间了，我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spell, I reckon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在门口找到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this in the doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫术球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witch ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我听说过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've I heard of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人，就是这个留下了那个印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what made that mark there, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是科拉·费舍尔干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said Cora Fisher did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么，你认识她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候她还不是女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't a witch back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱下那男孩的衣服煮了，同时喊着科拉·费舍尔的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off that boy's clothes and boil them, calling it out Cora Fisher's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是她下的咒，这样就能破解\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's one that witched him, that'll bust the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去那儿，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You going up there, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.94,0:09:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我想我会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, reckon I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过先去看看我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}First I'm going to stop by and see my mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她，呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.21,0:09:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去世了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:09:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她哥哥来接她，带她回东部去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her brother come up to fetch her Took her back East.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，那不是，呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ain't that, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.01,0:10:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我爸呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what about my daddy, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,再没怎么见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never did see much of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你离开后就没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not once since you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.19,0:10:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜他最后是喝酒喝死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess he finally drunk himself to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直都不是个好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He weren't ever much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，朋友们，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士，我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}ma'am, I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，费雷尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a second, Mr Ferrell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，是这个名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个女巫，科拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}this witch, Cora.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以说，呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might say, eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事情属于我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}this sort of thing falls under our.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,专业领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}sphere of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你介意我们一起去吗？ - 抱歉，汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you mind if we come along? - Excuse us Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.69,0:10:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 实地考察 - 实地考察？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Field work - Field work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.05,0:10:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能活着真是幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带你回总部，\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking you back to headquarters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是你该待的地方，在图书馆里，\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you belong, in the library,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把咖啡洒在你那些奇怪的旧书上\N{\fnArial\fs30}spilling coffee on your weird old books.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:10:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有些蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己也说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「这地方有股味道」\N{\fnArial\fs30}'This place has the stink'
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是你不该在这里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's exactly why you shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.24,0:11:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我需要理解它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I I need to understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？不是从某本奇怪的旧书里，而是亲身体验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? And not from some weird old book, but for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说，你真的那么急着告诉布鲁姆我们丢了货物吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, are you really in such a hurry to tell Broom we lost the cargo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们要一起来就快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If y'all are coming along you best come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:25.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,[歌曲：狂欢乐队的《死者的漫步》]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[song: 'Dead Man's Stroll' by The Revels]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 也许你不相信，但必须说出来 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ May not believe it but it has to be told ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.09,0:11:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 一个可怜的灵魂在做亡者漫步 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ A poor soul doing the Dead Man's Stroll ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.77,0:11:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.82,0:12:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼神恍惚\N{\fnArial\fs30}all pie-eyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来找奥克姆奶奶干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you come see, Grammy Oakum for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.53,0:12:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想知道如何制作女巫球\N{\fnArial\fs30}they want to know how to make a witch ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.93,0:12:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我来告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很简单，\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy peasy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要裸体跳舞，\N{\fnArial\fs30}you dance around,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一丝不挂\N{\fnArial\fs30}buck naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.19,0:12:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,边喊：黄鼠狼的血，\N{\fnArial\fs30}calling out: Blood of weasel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠的尾巴，\N{\fnArial\fs30}tail a rat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑猫的内脏和膀胱，\N{\fnArial\fs30}guts and bladder of a black cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,秃鹰蛋和婴儿指甲，\N{\fnArial\fs30}buzzard eggs and baby's nails,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.95,0:12:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,蟾蜍的脚，\N{\fnArial\fs30}foot of toad frog,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠的脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}brain of bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你把锅烧开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you put a pot to boil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.86,0:12:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些都放进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it all goes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,剪下你头上的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut some hairs from your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,和下面的毛，\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your nethers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wrap 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.35,0:13:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,缠绕在锅里的东西上\N{\fnArial\fs30}round a gob of stuff from the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,做成圆形，大小适合投掷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make 'em round and a good size for throwing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,想用灵魂换些毒球\N{\fnArial\fs30}wanna trade your souls for some balls of poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰米·奥克姆说：「尽管去做吧」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grammy Oakum says: 'Go right at it'
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱见你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.86,0:13:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,杂志说他们在英国的一座教堂里发现了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magazine said they found you in a church in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.74,0:13:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是这么告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道魔鬼是不能踏入教堂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody knows the devil can't set foot in no church.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我其实不是，呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm not actually, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.49,0:13:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我见过那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, I met that son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他长得一点都不像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He don't look nothing like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.59,0:13:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是科拉的住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's Cora's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.94,0:14:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是汤姆！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·费雷尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom Ferrell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.15,0:14:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.63,0:14:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和这个女孩很熟悉，是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew this girl pretty well, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们，呃，那时还是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}we, uh, we weren't much more than kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是恋人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were sweethearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:14:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为我们会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured we'd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很久以前的事了，我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long time ago, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.75,0:16:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的女巫球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great Fucking witch balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，伙计们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看这个情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定是出去四处游荡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must be out roaming around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要等她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just gotta wait for her to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该是她的恶魔使魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be her demon familiar, I suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate those.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们以依附的女巫为食\N{\fnArial\fs30}They feed on the witch they're attached to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们互相吞噬\N{\fnArial\fs30}They feed off each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫和动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The witch, the animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据传说，它们作为共生寄生虫运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the lore, they function as symbiotic parasites.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,主啊，求你怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我母亲是个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother was a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌他们在你的杂志里没提到这个小细节，对吧，汤姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet they left that little detail out of your magazine, huh, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见过我的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never met my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.74,0:17:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也从未想过见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.75,0:18:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所知道的关于女巫的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything I ever knew about witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.97,0:18:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我从未知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在来这里的路上你提到你见过魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the way up here you mentioned you saw the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.80,0:18:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约15年前，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some 15 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在离这里一英里的地方，\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a mile from this very spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.51,0:18:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来到一条小溪，然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}come upon a stream, and.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.07,0:18:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}there she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不是魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的名字叫艾菲·科尔布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name was Effie Kolb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.21,0:18:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一眼就看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.43,0:18:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会带来麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很惭愧地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ashamed to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之后我完全忘记了可怜的科拉·费舍尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot all about poor old Cora Fisher after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，艾菲，\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Effie,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个女巫，她把我搞得一团糟，\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was a witch, and she got me all twisted up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我觉得也许我也该成为一个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}thinking maybe I ought to be a witch, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有那些关于拥有控制他人力量的谈话，\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all that talk about having power over other folks,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来真的很诱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}made it sound real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.11,0:19:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以，我出去弄来了一只死黑猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I went out and I got me a dead black cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁我妈出门时，我在炉子上煮它\N{\fnArial\fs30}While my Ma was out, I boiled it on the stovetop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到它全部分解\N{\fnArial\fs30}till it went all to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.20,0:19:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把那团东西带到小溪边，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took that mess down to the creek,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,清洗骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}to clean off the bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾菲告诉我当魔鬼出现时我正拿着的那块骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Effie told me whatever bone I was holding when the devil showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就会成为我的幸运骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was gonna be my lucky bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,太随意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So arbitrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一眼就认出了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew him right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听过关于他的传说一辈子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard tales about him all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,安塞姆先生，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister Onselm,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些老人称他为\N{\fnArial\fs30}some of the old folks called him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数人只叫他「弯曲的人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most just called him the, Crooked Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,弯曲的人 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crooked Man Uhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说，安塞姆先生是几百年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}As story goes, Mr Onselm was one of the first white men.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:19:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从欧洲来到这里的第一批白人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}who came here from Europe hundreds of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在南北战争中两边都参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}He played both sides in the war between the states.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成为了一个非常富有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came to be a very rich man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.73,0:20:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来是个真正聪明的小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a real clever little fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did that work out for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.26,0:20:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说天堂没有太多富人的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say heaven don't have much room for rich folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但下面有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got plenty down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把他送回来，\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sent him back up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他索取灵魂而不是法定货币\N{\fnArial\fs30}to claim souls instead of legal tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说他拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say he takes a.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.89,0:20:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个铜便士\N{\fnArial\fs30}a copper penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为每个为魔鬼索取的灵魂的报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}for every soul he claims for the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他得到足够多，有一天他会再次变得富有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets enough of them, one day he'll be rich again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.89,0:20:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看一眼老安塞姆先生就把我所有巫术的想法都吓跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One look at old Mr Onselm scared all them witchy thoughts right out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.64,0:20:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我点着灯回家，一路上发誓要重新做个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got lit off for home, swearing the whole way to be good again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.21,0:20:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至把那个幸运骨头扔得远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even took that lucky bone, threw it as far as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知怎的，我始终无法摆脱它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow I never could be rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家时我吓坏了，就一直往前跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so scared when I got home, I just kept right on running.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这就是我怎么进了军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess that's how I wound up in the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.27,0:21:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我熬过来了，\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.75,0:21:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫发无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}without a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是因为我天生幸运，\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't because I was born lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明，\N{\fnArial\fs30}smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}quite the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.34,0:21:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got power in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那个老巫婆说的：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that old witch said:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有伤害人的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got the power to hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从未使用过它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.26,0:21:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我说的，我这辈子从未希望伤害任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, I never wished harm on anybody my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是那些拼命想给我打洞的家伙们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not even them boys over there trying their damndest to put holes in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这是不是意味着，我其实不是巫师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that means, I ain't really a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到什么了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.31,0:23:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.97,0:23:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.19,0:23:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh! Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.50,0:23:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，科拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Cora.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.95,0:23:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆，你不该看到我这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't see me like this, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.52,0:23:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘，嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.82,0:23:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.82,0:23:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，科拉，没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cora, it's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.65,0:23:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘，嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.92,0:23:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔，喜欢这外勤工作吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoying that field work, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.14,0:24:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么习惯这个的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you get used to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.41,0:24:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带你去火堆旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you by the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.32,0:24:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉，你为什么要这么做？嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you done it, Cora? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.72,0:24:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那时我是个蠢货，\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I was a shit for brains kid back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.59,0:24:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是聪明的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you was the smart one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.29,0:24:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走后，我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you left, I didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.38,0:24:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只好跟内特·索斯比在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to go up with, Nate Southby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.29,0:24:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们结婚了，但他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We married, but he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.03,0:24:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的孩子也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our babies died.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆，我完全孤单一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was all alone, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.65,0:24:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的，你现在只需要休息，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's alright, You just gotta rest now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.87,0:24:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你只需要休息 - 他们要来抓我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just gotta rest - They're coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.26,0:24:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆，他们就在外面 他们想要我的灵魂，他们会得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're out there, Tom They want my soul, and they gonna have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.57,0:24:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里他们就不行 我在这里就不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not while I'm here Not while, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.09,0:24:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，嘘，嘘，嘘，嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Shh, shh, shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.19,0:24:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在外面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.75,0:24:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.84,0:24:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘，嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.46,0:24:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来这里就像个死城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Deadsville to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.82,0:25:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.00,0:25:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.66,0:25:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.27,0:25:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我来见的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't who I come to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.93,0:25:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我真喜欢你的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't I just like the look of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.67,0:25:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从来就不怎么穿教堂里那种衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never did have much use for going to church clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.20,0:25:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's my Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.42,0:25:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看起来一点也不比我上次见她时老\N{\fnArial\fs30}She don't look a day older than the last time I saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.29,0:25:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道一个女巫有多老，\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to tell how old a witch is,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.81,0:25:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得砍下她的腿数树轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gotta cut her leg off and count the rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.16,0:25:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米，你回来看我了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come back to see me, Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.51,0:25:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼，我才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell no, I ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.65,0:25:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是来见谁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I came to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.95,0:25:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不是那可怜虫科拉·费舍尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that pitiful thing, Cora Fisher I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.61,0:26:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她甚至不值得折磨，但我还是这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, she ain't even much worth tormenting, but I do it all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.88,0:26:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女孩要怎么打发时间呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's a girl expected to pass the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.23,0:26:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米，我不知道你在那个悲惨的小东西身上看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you ever saw in that tragic little creature, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.59,0:26:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她几乎没有什么灵魂可以偷走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why she barely got any soul to steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.72,0:26:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再提她的名字，你这个邪恶的老妓女！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep her name out of your mouth, you wicked old whore!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.94,0:26:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.86,0:26:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得我喜欢怎么玩吗，汤姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You 'member how I like to play, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.73,0:26:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.21,0:26:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.09,0:26:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he knows it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.31,0:26:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有，\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.13,0:26:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就叫它\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's just call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.88,0:26:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你未了的心愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}un-finished business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.10,0:26:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.40,0:26:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算了结它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I aim to finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.32,0:26:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.54,0:27:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.06,0:27:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是那个精力旺盛但不太理智的野兔，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still a wild hare with more spunk than sense, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.46,0:27:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey that's enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.41,0:27:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉你的主人，如果他想伤害这些可怜的人，\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell your master if he wants to get to these poor folks,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.37,0:27:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得先过我这关\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gonna have to go through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.25,0:27:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你？哈，先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You? Ha Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.68,0:27:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一点也不怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}he ain't a tiny bit afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.56,0:27:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有，汤姆，\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Tommy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.04,0:27:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I near forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.91,0:27:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我给你带个礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked me to give you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.96,0:27:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.61,0:27:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕他看起来不怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Fraid he don't look like much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.87,0:27:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你走后，我每晚都骑他骑得很狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been riding him pretty hard every night since you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.92,0:27:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜他差不多被用坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess he pretty near wore out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.93,0:27:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的你，艾菲·科尔布！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curse you, Effie Kolb!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.49,0:27:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.93,0:27:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.50,0:27:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,放射性的，伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radioactive, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.72,0:27:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.64,0:27:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.86,0:27:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.35,0:28:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你做了什么，爸爸？什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd they do to you, Daddy? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.66,0:28:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 嘘，嘘，嘘 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy Shh, shh, shh Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.71,0:28:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.66,0:28:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗，孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.80,0:28:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你，你回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.50,0:28:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.67,0:28:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.55,0:28:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，爸爸 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Daddy I.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.43,0:28:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.43,0:28:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃茨牧师还在山腰上那个小教堂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Reverend Watts still in that little church up on the side of the mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.39,0:28:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，但你不能去那里，汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is, but you can't go up there, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.31,0:28:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到艾菲·科尔布说的了，\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard Effie Kolb,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.40,0:29:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,弯曲人在等着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crooked Man's waiting on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.49,0:29:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.84,0:29:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这就是我回来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's why I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.89,0:29:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和那个老魔鬼了结恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I'd have it out with that old devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.02,0:29:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我把这个罪人埋在教堂地里之前不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not before I get this sinner buried in church ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.11,0:29:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天啊，科拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.55,0:29:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.52,0:29:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.83,0:29:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不想让我压扁吗？- 不，\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't want me to squash? - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.87,0:29:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,压扁很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}squashing's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.35,0:29:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally approve of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.78,0:29:45.91,Title,0,0,0,0,,[歌曲：莫里·莫里森管弦乐团和爱丽斯·豪泽的《是你吗》]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[song: 'Did You' by Morrie Morrison Orchestra ft Alyce Hauser]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.62,0:29:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 你曾真心爱过我吗？♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Did you ever really love me? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.24,0:29:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 你曾真的在乎过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Did you ever really care?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.64,0:30:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 你曾真的想念过我吗？♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Did you ever really miss me? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.08,0:30:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 亲吻我，\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Kiss me,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.08,0:30:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我怀疑你的心是否曾在那里 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I wonder if your heart was ever there ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.48,0:30:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.57,0:30:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.01,0:30:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，试着睡会儿，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, try to get some Z's, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.49,0:30:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.85,0:30:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 还是你真的说了谎 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Or did you really tell a lie ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.77,0:30:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 你曾真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Did you ever really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.69,0:31:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 真的在乎过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ ever really care?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.22,0:31:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 真的爱过我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Ever really love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.11,0:31:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我照看他一会儿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to take him for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.37,0:31:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，是我的罪孽造成的，他是我必须承担的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's my sins that done it, He's my burden to carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.38,0:31:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个角度想，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of it a little different,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.86,0:31:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为罪孽只是我们本性的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think sins are just a part of who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.16,0:31:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们生来就有，死时也带着它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're born with them and we'll die with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.78,0:31:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指亚当和夏娃那种原罪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like a Adam and Eve kind of sin?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.82,0:31:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指那些甩不掉的罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean sins you can't shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.17,0:31:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍掉它们，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw 'em off,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.74,0:31:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们又会长回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they just grow back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.92,0:31:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，我是在打比方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm speaking metaphorically, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.49,0:32:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人很友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friendly folks around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.58,0:32:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是该死的地球盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt of the damn earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.84,0:32:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你能帮我解答一些疑问，科拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can help me with something, Cora.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.46,0:32:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.89,0:32:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在研究咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been studying spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.90,0:32:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是如何运作的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes them tick?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.98,0:32:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是说出咒语那么简单，对吧？我是说，\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more than just the words, right? I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.03,0:32:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,单靠咒语本身是没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}an incantation on its own does nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.25,0:32:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，就我而言，我把灵魂卖给了魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in my case, I sold my mortal soul off to the Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.95,0:32:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这可能有助于让事情顺利进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that probably helps grease the wheels some.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.30,0:32:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.82,0:32:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此之外呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.01,0:32:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要触动你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needs to touch your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.97,0:32:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我施展诅咒时，\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I do a hex,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.97,0:32:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想到最悲伤的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think of the saddest thing I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.41,0:32:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这似乎能让魔法变得更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}That seems to make the magic come on stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.98,0:32:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不关我的事，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't none of my business,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.85,0:32:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士，\N{\fnArial\fs30}ma'am,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.33,0:33:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在尝试使用巫术吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you been trying to do witch magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.21,0:33:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just research.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.60,0:33:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要非常小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to be real careful with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.28,0:33:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,煤矿区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coal mining country.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.71,0:33:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.24,0:33:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个地区都是蛇形的隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}whole territory's snake full of tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.24,0:33:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这片森林是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If these woods are alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.24,0:33:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,隧道就像皮肤下的血管\N{\fnArial\fs30}tunnels are like veins underneath the skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.22,0:33:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.57,0:33:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.05,0:34:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.96,0:34:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉？科拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora? Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.79,0:34:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.32,0:34:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉！？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora!?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.06,0:34:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 科拉？ - 科拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cora? - Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.49,0:34:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.83,0:34:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.48,0:35:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.75,0:35:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arg!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.02,0:35:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.81,0:35:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.57,0:36:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.31,0:36:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.75,0:36:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.50,0:36:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.33,0:36:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.38,0:36:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道魔鬼不能踏入教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody knows the devil can't set foot in no church.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.69,0:37:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.47,0:37:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.04,0:37:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你妈妈，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your mama, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.05,0:37:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我来说是新闻，我从没见过她的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's news to me, I've never seen her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.19,0:37:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我想那就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess that's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.75,0:37:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她试图逃避为那些罪孽付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tried to get out of paying for all them sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.97,0:37:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她将永无宁日，备受折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she'll have no rest from tormenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.63,0:38:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经很多天没睡过觉了，多到我数不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ain't slept a wink for more days than I know how to count.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.07,0:38:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪孽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sins?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.07,0:38:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没那么严重吧，\N{\fnArial\fs30}They couldn't have been that bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.29,0:38:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.82,0:38:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪孽众多。与恶魔勾结，\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were many Consorted with demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.52,0:38:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑着黑山羊飞行，参加魔鬼聚会，\N{\fnArial\fs30}flew upon the black goat and gave herself for the Sabbat,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.00,0:38:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,变形成害虫，\N{\fnArial\fs30}changed her shape into that of varmints,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.05,0:38:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一些说不出名字的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and things unnameable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.53,0:38:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.81,0:38:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.50,0:38:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一只该死的大鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a big fucking bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.81,0:38:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽有许多形态，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast takes many forms,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.99,0:38:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}this be but one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.21,0:38:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.51,0:38:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.82,0:38:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.30,0:38:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.09,0:39:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怜悯我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.74,0:39:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你原谅我，让我去见上帝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you will forgive me, let me go up to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.35,0:39:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,去见上帝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To God?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.49,0:39:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这里才是你应该待的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}No This is where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.27,0:39:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的主\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.14,0:39:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My master.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.76,0:39:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能给你什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What more can I give thee?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.28,0:39:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.59,0:39:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉不到体内正在孕育新的生命吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you not feel the new life growing inside you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.77,0:39:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.07,0:39:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个黑暗的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dark thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.16,0:39:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malignant.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.82,0:39:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能，因为我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be for I am dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.17,0:39:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向漆黑的夜晚歌唱，\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sang out to the deep of night,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜晚的生物回应了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the night things answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.04,0:39:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你将给这个世界一份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you will give the world a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.05,0:39:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.62,0:39:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.75,0:40:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个美丽的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A beautiful son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.59,0:40:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.33,0:40:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，慢点，慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woah, easy there, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.81,0:40:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.68,0:40:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦天啊，我的头感觉像是被米尼·米诺索击中了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shit, my head feels like, Minnie Minoso took a swing at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.69,0:40:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.47,0:40:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把你带回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.87,0:40:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉 科拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.62,0:40:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.63,0:40:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.99,0:41:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.13,0:41:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了那个幸运骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used the lucky bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.48,0:41:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我之前不是女巫的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wasn't a witch before.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.79,0:41:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我肯定是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I surely am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.30,0:41:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你，爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.52,0:41:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是圣地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's consecrated ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.87,0:42:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把你带进去吧，你这个老罪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you inside, you old sinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.28,0:42:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.55,0:42:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗？汤姆·费雷尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you? Tom Ferrell?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.16,0:42:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的，牧师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know, Reverend?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.04,0:42:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.21,0:42:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.26,0:42:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a girl here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.95,0:42:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们来之前几分钟进来的 大胆得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in a couple of minutes before you fellas Bold as brass.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.83,0:42:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.01,0:42:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.27,0:42:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她是个幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe she a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.58,0:42:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是科拉·费雪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it Cora Fisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.80,0:42:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉·费雪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora Fisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.80,0:42:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.93,0:43:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得她还是个小蝌蚪的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember her when she was just a little tadpole.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.50,0:43:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼可能得到了她的身体，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil might have got a body,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.90,0:43:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有得到她的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he didn't get her soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.64,0:43:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你爸爸，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's y'daddy, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.00,0:43:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他应该被安葬在适当的教堂墓地里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured he ought to be buried in proper church ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.91,0:43:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.26,0:43:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.92,0:43:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想你来飓风山还有另一个目的，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think you got another purpose for being up here on the Hurricane, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.49,0:43:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.23,0:43:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们，呃，\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.63,0:43:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的目标是爬上那座山\N{\fnArial\fs30}we aim to go up that hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.98,0:43:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去他的房子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to his house?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.24,0:43:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，为什么有人会想做这种蠢事呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why would any damn fool want to do a thing like that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.13,0:44:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daddy's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.09,0:44:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,科拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cora.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.78,0:44:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.74,0:44:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉，姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.70,0:44:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许唯一能做的就是向他投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe all that's left to do is surrender myself to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.14,0:44:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他，拿走我的身体，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him, take my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.36,0:44:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走我的灵魂，\N{\fnArial\fs30}take my soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.19,0:44:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走你该死的一分钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}take your goddamn penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.41,0:44:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我的良心上不再有杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so long as there's no more killing on my conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.11,0:44:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟，交易就是交易，不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, a deal's a deal, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.11,0:44:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太荒谬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.64,0:44:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那时只是个孩子，与恶魔实体的交易？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just a kid, A deal with a demonic entity?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.86,0:44:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能具有约束力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can that possibly be binding?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.60,0:44:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦，它是有约束力的 - 地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, it be binding - Hellboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.25,0:44:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，它某种程度上是有约束力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's kind of binding.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.26,0:44:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，可能还有一些回旋的余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there may be some wiggle room.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.26,0:44:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我来这里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I'm here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.74,0:44:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}To renegotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.57,0:44:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈判个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negotiate, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.92,0:44:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，他看起来像个很有说服力的家伙，牧师，不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he do seem like a pretty persuasive fella, Reverend, don't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.53,0:45:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,人的骄傲和愚蠢，就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men's pride and folly, all that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.71,0:45:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，如果你们要去，最好在太阳高挂天空时去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're gonna go, best do it when the sun's up in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.15,0:45:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的力量在黑暗中最强\N{\fnArial\fs30}His power's strongest when it's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.15,0:45:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们今晚就在这里过夜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all stay here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.72,0:45:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧走了，牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to boogie-woogie, preach.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.20,0:45:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来我们还有一些日光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we still have some daylight left.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.42,0:45:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.17,0:45:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那，那，不，等等，那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, that's, no, wait, that's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.00,0:45:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，地球，地球不会旋转。它，它，不是这样运作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the Earth, the Earth doesn't spin It, it, that's not how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.18,0:45:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在飓风中是按他的时间来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We on his time up in the, Hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.84,0:45:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有同伴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.76,0:45:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些地方周围有很多女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of witches around these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.67,0:45:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.63,0:46:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前也有很多普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to be plenty of regular folks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.85,0:46:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今，大多数都是女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nowadays, mostly just witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.56,0:46:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈！哈利路亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haha! Hallelujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.08,0:46:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要引导盲人走他们不知道的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will lead the blind by a way they know not.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.70,0:46:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要为他们把黑暗变为光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will make the darkness light for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.27,0:46:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把弯曲的地方变直\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the crooked things straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.40,0:46:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄涅洛斯和诺特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oneiros und Nótt.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.23,0:46:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你们的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}SchlieBßen Sie ihre Augen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.72,0:46:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要触动你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needs to touch your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.59,0:46:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我施咒时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I do a hex.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.29,0:46:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想到我能想到的最悲伤的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think of the saddest thing I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.38,0:46:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让你们的心烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let not your hearts be troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.91,0:46:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些女巫不能踏足这片圣地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them witches Can't set foot on this holy ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.56,0:47:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那黑魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that black magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.52,0:47:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里也没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.48,0:47:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们很快就会知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we'll find out soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.92,0:47:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子，你怀疑祈祷的力量吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You doubt the power of prayers, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.76,0:47:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是喜欢随身携带一些超高口径的弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just like to have some excessively high-caliber ammo on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.50,0:47:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.29,0:47:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Sheee Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.45,0:47:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.79,0:47:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.45,0:47:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.84,0:48:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在里面能听到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can hear me in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.63,0:48:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天还没遇到够麻烦吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't you had enough trouble for one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.98,0:48:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦才刚刚开始呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't even really begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.03,0:48:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所有在教堂里的朋友，\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your friends in that church with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.81,0:48:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}they all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.25,0:48:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All on your account.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.47,0:48:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么你必须出来面对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you gotta come out and face him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.28,0:48:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,猫王的屁股都没抖得这么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elvis's ass don't shake this hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.24,0:48:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,牧师，煤矿是不是就在这座教堂下面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverend, the coal mines, do they run under this church?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.16,0:48:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，它们遍布各处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they run everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.90,0:49:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约30年前发生过一次煤矿坍塌 上一次地面这样摇晃时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A coal mine collapsed about 30 years ago Last time the ground shook like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.77,0:49:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,100人丧生\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 men killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.86,0:49:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,被活埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buried alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.12,0:49:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个建教堂的好地方，是吧，乔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great place to build a church, huh, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.26,0:49:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.35,0:49:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白有什么好笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see what's so godforsaken funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.63,0:50:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小汤姆·法瑞尔，回来见我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Tom Ferrell, come back to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.46,0:50:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的幸运骨头带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me my lucky bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.77,0:50:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来取回它了，汤姆·法瑞尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come to collect it, Tom Ferrell.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.47,0:50:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我会把它给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah and I'm gonna give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.00,0:50:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得答应我一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta make me one promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.35,0:50:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要伤害那些在里面的好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No harm comes to those good folks in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.92,0:50:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是是你把他们置于危险之中的，\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was you who put them in harms way,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.31,0:50:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}not I.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.32,0:51:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.11,0:51:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.40,0:51:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.66,0:51:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，我不喜欢这个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I don't like this deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.75,0:51:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太想要它了，\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want it too bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.15,0:51:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我不想让你得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that makes me not want you to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.54,0:51:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧，汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on inside, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.37,0:51:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.85,0:51:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，你可真是个丑陋的狗娘养的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ain't you a pug-ugly son of a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.90,0:51:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话说的好像五十步笑百步，但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pot calling the kettle black here, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.21,0:51:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus H.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.79,0:52:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.70,0:52:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,树上那个色情狂女人说你不怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nympho-broad in the tree mentioned you weren't afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.49,0:52:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你猜怎么着？我也不怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well guess what? I'm not afraid of you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.40,0:52:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你为什么不转身，\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you turn around,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.36,0:52:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着你那歪斜的屁股滚出这里，还有那些头晕目眩的婊子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}take your crooked ass out of here, and take those dizzy bitches with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.24,0:52:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前的表现很不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a different aspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.85,0:52:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你看着你母亲被烧死的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you watched your mother burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.90,0:52:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈在说什么，橡皮泥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell you say, Gumby?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.64,0:52:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这个教堂滚出去，安瑟姆先生 你现在就滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be gone from this church, Mr Onselm You be gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.56,0:52:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到她的样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw how she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.91,0:52:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个悲伤的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sorrowful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.08,0:52:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她受苦了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}She suffers so.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.70,0:52:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有能力缓解她的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have it in my power to mollify her pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.05,0:52:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她有羽毛的灵魂展翅高飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her feathered soul take wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.31,0:53:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.71,0:53:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.62,0:53:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.15,0:53:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要求你回报一点小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something small in return is all I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.76,0:53:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是扭下那个小汤姆·法瑞尔的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you twist off the head of that little Tom Ferrell.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.15,0:53:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把它带到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bring it hither.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.46,0:53:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.68,0:53:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在重新谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}renegotiating.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.69,0:53:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我们可以达成共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure we can see eye to eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.56,0:53:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.09,0:53:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体内流着巫师的血，朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got witch blood in you, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.48,0:53:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你更像我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're more like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.83,0:53:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是像他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}than you are like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.88,0:53:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，蛇，让我们战斗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, snake, let's rattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.34,0:54:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.43,0:54:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.57,0:54:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.15,0:54:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！他死定了 他肯定死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! He's kilt He's kilt for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.24,0:54:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！我没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arg! I ain't kilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.85,0:54:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能永远躲在那里，汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't hide in there forever, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.20,0:54:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,歪曲人会耗尽你的力气，小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crooked Man gonna wear you out, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.77,0:54:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，闭上你那该死的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you shut your cursed mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.52,0:54:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会给你带来比你那醉鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gonna heap sorrows on you a hundred times worse than what you drunken.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.95,0:54:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,爹爹还要糟糕百倍的悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}daddy ever got.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.70,0:55:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我的脑子里滚出去，你这个女巫！女巫！从我的脑子里滚出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get out of my skull, you witch! Witch! Get out of my skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.40,0:55:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.96,0:55:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.23,0:55:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.01,0:55:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.54,0:55:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道，牧师，交易就是交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we both know, Reverend, a deal's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.41,0:55:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.89,0:55:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会从你那里买下那块幸运骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll buy that lucky bone from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.50,0:55:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有东西可以卖给你，安塞姆先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't nothing in here for sale to you, Mr Onselm.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.82,0:55:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.43,0:55:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.34,0:55:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃！啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urmm! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.86,0:55:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，乔，你得再用力拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Joe, you gotta pull harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.43,0:55:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油！ - 啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.30,0:55:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，我知道你不需要法定货币，老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh, I know you got no use for legal tender, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.44,0:55:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但时间呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about time?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.44,0:55:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会给多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you give for.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.05,0:55:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,十年的时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ten years of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.75,0:55:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒旦，你对我做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing to me, Satan?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.62,0:55:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.63,0:56:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十年呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}twenty?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.37,0:56:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便把你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fix up those.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.41,0:56:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛也修复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}eyes of yours while we're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.20,0:56:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.56,0:56:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，先生！我的年岁和病痛都是自然而来的，\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir! I come fairly by my years and my afflictions,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.17,0:56:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't want nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.22,0:56:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾比·赖利毒死了两个丈夫，她是怎么被埋在教堂墓地的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abby Riley done poisoned two husbands, How'd she get planted in a church yard?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.14,0:56:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这片圣地里埋葬了太多罪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many sinners in this consecrated ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.60,0:57:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉体腐烂，但罪孽永存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flesh rots, but the sin goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.92,0:57:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.45,0:57:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，你确定你没事吗？因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, are you sure you're okay? Because.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.53,0:57:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把手指伸进去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to stick your finger in?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.19,0:57:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.23,0:57:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能一直这样流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't keep bleeding like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.63,0:57:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.89,0:57:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，不，你不会没事的 - 芭比·乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, you will not be fine - Bobbie Jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.02,0:57:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是工作的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.80,0:57:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？我迫不及待要抓住那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I can't wait to get my hands on that Howdy Doody fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.92,0:58:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏不断上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hits just keep on coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.08,0:58:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来有点不一样，是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks a little different, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.60,0:58:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.56,0:58:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直喜欢漂亮姑娘，是吗，牧师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always did like them pretty girls, didn't you, Reverend?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.78,0:58:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到你在做礼拜日讲道时一直盯着我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could feel your eyes on me giving them Sunday sermons.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.36,0:58:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去躺下吧，艾比盖尔，这不再是你的世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go lay back down, Abigail, This ain't your world no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.97,0:58:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,吻我吧，神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss me, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.06,0:58:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你一直想要的那样吻我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss me like you always wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.98,0:59:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,吻这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.30,0:59:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.52,0:59:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莉·希克斯，通奸者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Callie Hicks, fornicator.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.52,0:59:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,通奸者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fornicator!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.09,0:59:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾贝尔·雅各布斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abel Jacobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.88,0:59:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.49,0:59:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔西·沃德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Josie Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.92,0:59:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,风流者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philanderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.41,0:59:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼利·兰格里什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manly Langrishe.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.28,0:59:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,醉醺醺地躺着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lying drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.98,0:59:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,醉醺醺地躺着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lying drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.55,0:59:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,内森·格林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nathan Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.29,0:59:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.82,0:59:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,像县集市上的鸭子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like ducks at the county fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.86,0:59:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗洛拉·苏·贝克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flora Sue Baker.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.26,1:00:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,出轨的妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheatin' whore.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.91,1:00:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,出轨的妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheatin' whore.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.30,1:00:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾达·考德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ada Calder.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.44,1:00:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀害儿童的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Child killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.62,1:00:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经死了，被埋葬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were dead, and buried.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.10,1:00:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪过被宽恕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sins were forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.23,1:00:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,宽恕不等于遗忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgiven don't mean forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.28,1:00:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀亚特·费雷尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wyatt Ferrell.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.85,1:00:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,醉醺醺的老傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drunken old fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.37,1:00:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.42,1:00:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agsk.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.38,1:00:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.25,1:00:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.12,1:00:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，等等，等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.91,1:00:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.36,1:01:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.76,1:01:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,主啊，我再也不想看这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, I can't look on this no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.11,1:01:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走我的眼睛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my eyes away.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.90,1:01:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要魔鬼的任何礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want no gifts from the devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.34,1:01:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.31,1:01:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·费雷尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom Ferrell!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.31,1:01:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个旧猫骨头给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that old cat bone!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.40,1:01:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没打算用它，牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was never gonna use it, Reverend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.45,1:01:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看我并不是个完美的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You watch now I ain't no perfect man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.80,1:01:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.23,1:01:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心里和其他人一样也有阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a shadow in my heart like anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.93,1:01:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你会看到那道光的，汤姆·费雷尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you gonna see that light, Tom Ferrell.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.46,1:02:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会让它在你内心灿烂地燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna let it blaze bright inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.46,1:02:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那道光在我心中燃烧一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that light be blazing in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.56,1:02:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我热血沸腾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all fired up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.13,1:02:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把那邪恶彻底打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna bust that evil wide open.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.13,1:02:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要挤压它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna squeeze it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.48,1:02:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把圣灵挤进\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna squeeze the, Holy Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.53,1:02:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个邪恶的不幸骨头里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}into this vile unlucky bone!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.01,1:02:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.10,1:02:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看它燃烧吧，汤姆·费雷尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it blaze, Tom Ferrell.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.19,1:02:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.46,1:02:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这院子里的每一个坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every grave in this yards.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.51,1:02:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是用这把铲子挖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}been dug with this shovel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.08,1:02:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它不充满上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it ain't full of God.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.73,1:02:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就没有什么是充满上帝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then nothing is.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.39,1:03:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的杖，你的竿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thy rod and thy staff!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.01,1:03:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们安慰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They comfort me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.05,1:03:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.06,1:03:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.84,1:03:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.24,1:04:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊-啊 地狱男爵，不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah-ah Hellboy, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.11,1:04:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们报告情况然后带着局里的整个团队回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call this in and come back with the whole team from the bureau.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.42,1:04:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好现在就解决他，他受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better to finish this, He's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.37,1:04:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.51,1:04:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔，你完事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe, you're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.59,1:04:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这里陪牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staying back here with the Reverend.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.73,1:04:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 我们不回来了，\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No - We don't come back,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.90,1:04:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续下山，一直走到找到电话为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}you keep going down that mountain and you don't stop until you find a telephone.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.95,1:04:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要回到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever come back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.65,1:04:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.14,1:04:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上铲子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the shovel.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.00,1:04:39.92,Title,0,0,0,0,,[歌曲：宾利乐队的《魔法海》]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[song: 'Enchanted Sea' by The Bentleys]
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.72,1:04:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知它一直被这么称呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been called that since I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.85,1:04:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前，一场飓风吹倒了这座山上的一片树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time back a hurricane blew down a mess of trees on this mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.12,1:04:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们再也没有长回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never grew back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.12,1:04:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还活着的人没人记得那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one still alive remembers it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.47,1:05:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能已经是一千年前的事了，我也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might have been a thousand years ago for all I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.17,1:05:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且，说不定根本就不是什么飓风\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hell, maybe it wasn't no hurricane at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.56,1:05:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.30,1:05:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.09,1:05:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安人说这里一直都不太平\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Indians say it's always been bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.70,1:05:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说这里有比大洪水还要古老的鬼魂和生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say there's ghosts and critters up here older than the flood.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.31,1:05:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,稀有动物，山怪精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scarce animals, Shonokins Mountain spirits.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.88,1:05:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here me out,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.36,1:05:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能在胡说八道，但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might be just talking out of my ass here, but.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.15,1:05:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能面对的是维度裂缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}might be looking at a dimensional rifting.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.71,1:05:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛夫克拉夫特式的场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovecraft type scenario.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.80,1:05:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,古老的神明强行进入我们世界那种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old gods forcing their way into our world type thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.72,1:05:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对那些一无所知，但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know nothing about that, but.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.85,1:05:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对是个诡异、邪恶的地方，这是肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a queer, bad feeling place, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.17,1:05:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要一把新铲子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna need a new shovel.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.74,1:05:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些山里有些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in these hills.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.96,1:05:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种闹鬼的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something haunted.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.53,1:06:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.40,1:06:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在树木里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the trees.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.57,1:06:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在泥土里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.67,1:06:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆说这些山就像一个活物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom said these hills were like a living thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.11,1:06:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.85,1:06:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说那些老矿井就像它的循环系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said the old mines were like its circulatory system.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.85,1:06:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的血管在地下蔓延\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its veins running underground.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.07,1:06:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得弯腰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Crooked Man, I think,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.33,1:06:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从中汲取力量的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he draws power from it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.90,1:06:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘，你是不是有什么想法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something on your mind, girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.69,1:06:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个不太好的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I don't like.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.21,1:06:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许如果我们破坏了力量源，就能伤害到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if we disrupt the power source, we can hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.21,1:06:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.48,1:06:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是破坏行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about sabotage.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.01,1:06:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是场战争，那些隧道是补给线，我们会埋炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this were a war and those tunnels were supply lines, we'd plant dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.19,1:06:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要炸毁那个矿井吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna dynamite that mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.28,1:06:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.67,1:06:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有更好的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe something better.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.67,1:06:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.02,1:06:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.81,1:07:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You outta your mother fucking mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.73,1:07:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这是否是真的，\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know if it was real,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.39,1:07:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是只是用来吓唬小孩子的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if it was just a story they tell little chaps to scare them.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.96,1:07:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.00,1:07:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也给我讲过这些故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me them stories too.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.43,1:07:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以用点女人的手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could use a woman's touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.62,1:08:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们下到那些矿井里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They go down into them mines.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.19,1:08:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我理解一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make me understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.45,1:08:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们要建一座教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}why they built a church.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.89,1:08:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个非常方便进入的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}on top of a very convenient access.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.33,1:08:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在一个塌陷的煤矿上面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a collapsed coal mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.42,1:08:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,像对小孩子解释那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain it to me like I'm a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.55,1:08:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢地解释给我听\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.21,1:08:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什-\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha-
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.29,1:08:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他们认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}S'ppose they thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.25,1:08:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是某种通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was some kind of doorway.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.91,1:08:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接这个世界和另一个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}'tween this world and the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.69,1:08:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想在上面建座教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They reckon they'd drop a church on top.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.09,1:08:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,使土地神圣化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consecrate the soil.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.31,1:08:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,堵住那个通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block the doorway.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.70,1:08:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not such a swell idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.88,1:08:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到今天为止一直都还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked all right up until today.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.71,1:09:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面很黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dark down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.80,1:09:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑得像魔鬼的屁股眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark as the devil's asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.94,1:09:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.85,1:09:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bringing this along.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.59,1:09:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许它还保留着一些神圣的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it got a bit of holy left in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.77,1:09:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.69,1:09:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，牧师，我 - 在下面，\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Reverend, I - Down there,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.21,1:09:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一样看不见，姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't much more blind than you is, girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.87,1:11:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为有钱人会举办一些很棒的派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always figured rich folks had them some real fine soirees.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.79,1:11:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.70,1:11:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.88,1:11:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.95,1:11:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.98,1:12:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌你希望你的朋友在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you wishing your friend was here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.68,1:12:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，他什么都不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's not afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.64,1:12:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我知道他害怕一件事：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know somethin' afraid of:
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.29,1:12:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他害怕告诉你他对你的真实感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}he afraid to tell you how he really feels about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.09,1:12:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.79,1:12:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.49,1:12:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.89,1:12:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么东西来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.38,1:12:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.82,1:13:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑，姑娘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.39,1:13:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！这边，这边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up! This way, this way!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.65,1:13:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将吞食你儿子的肉，\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he shall eat the flesh of your sons,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.70,1:13:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你女儿的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the flesh of your daughters.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.92,1:13:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都要吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall he eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.14,1:13:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在愤怒中毁灭他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy them in wrath.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.97,1:13:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.49,1:13:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they may be no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.59,1:13:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法不像子弹，姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic ain't like a bullet, girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.42,1:13:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能只是扣动扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.81,1:13:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事情光靠思考是无法理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some things you can't understand by thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.38,1:13:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来自灵魂，而不是肉体！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes from the spirits, not the meat!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.25,1:13:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.32,1:14:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.15,1:14:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.72,1:14:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.14,1:14:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米，你上次感受女人的抚摸是什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time you felt the touch of a woman, Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.97,1:14:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年来你一直如此孤独吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have all these years been so lonesome?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.15,1:14:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否坐在那里梦想着我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you sit up and dream about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.94,1:15:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，我打赌你一直在想着我抚摸你的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it, I bet you never stopped thinking about the way I touched you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.99,1:15:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米，你为我硬了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something hard for me, Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.69,1:15:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我硬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.04,1:15:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.99,1:15:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深知你是我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know well thou are my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.43,1:16:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thine eyes,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.87,1:16:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛证明了这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}thine eyes attest to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.83,1:16:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别假装这是什么美好的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not pretend this is some beautiful moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.58,1:16:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.27,1:16:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来就不在乎我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never gave a damn about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.36,1:16:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着我说这些话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thou should look upon me and say these things?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.89,1:16:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该让你烧死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should let you burn!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.50,1:16:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把你救出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.81,1:16:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我亲爱的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my sweet child.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.85,1:16:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法被拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be saved.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.60,1:16:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这烈火就是我的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}This burning be my fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.38,1:16:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我犯下的诸多罪行，\N{\fnArial\fs30}For them many sins I done,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.34,1:16:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有的女巫最终都是一样的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}all us witches end up the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.81,1:17:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一种方法能结束这痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way to end this pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.25,1:17:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭我吧，我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy me, my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.43,1:17:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.56,1:17:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.17,1:17:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能要求我这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't ask me to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.65,1:17:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你的蔑视\N{\fnArial\fs30}For thy scorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.87,1:17:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}For thy wrath.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.92,1:17:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你恨我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thou were right to hate me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.27,1:17:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨我自己！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hated myself!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.88,1:17:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myself!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.62,1:17:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个该死的你创造的怪物！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This goddam monster you made!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.21,1:18:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥涅伊洛斯和诺特，触碰我敌人的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oneiros und Nótt, beruührt die, Gedanken meiner Feinde.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.95,1:18:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上他们的眼睛，直到下一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}SchlieBßen Sie ihre Augen und fangen sie bis zum naächsten.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.26,1:18:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出前将他们困在梦中，奥涅伊洛斯和诺特，触碰思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonnenaufgang in Traäaumen ein, Oneiros und Nótt, beruührt die Gedanken.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.92,1:18:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上他们的眼睛，直到下一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}chlieBßen Sie ihre Augen und fangen sie bis zum naächsten.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.79,1:18:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥涅伊洛斯和诺特，触碰思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oneiros und Nótt, beruührt die Gedanken.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.80,1:18:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sie ihre Augen.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.15,1:18:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我如同一个梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me be as a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.93,1:18:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,被遗忘，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.11,1:18:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无意义的尘埃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dust without meaning.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.16,1:18:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥涅伊洛斯和诺特，触碰我敌人的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oneiros und Nótt, beruührt die, Gedanken meiner Feinde.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.64,1:18:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上他们的眼睛，直到下一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}SchlieBßen Sie ihre Augen und fangen sie bis zum naächsten.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.43,1:18:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一定还有别的办法 - 没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's gotta be another way - There is none.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.04,1:18:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥涅伊洛斯和诺特，触碰我敌人的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oneiros und Nótt, beruührt die, Gedanken meiner Feinde.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.70,1:18:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上他们的眼睛，直到下一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}SchlieBßen Sie ihre Augen und fangen sie bis zum naächsten.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.83,1:19:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出前将他们困在梦中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonnenaufgang in Traäaumen ein.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.40,1:19:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这痛苦，我再也无法忍受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This agony, I can't bare it any longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.23,1:19:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了！ - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.23,1:19:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.15,1:19:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.26,1:19:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧，大个子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alright, big fella?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.96,1:19:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of booby trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.61,1:19:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.79,1:19:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.27,1:19:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么打破了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}something broke it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.25,1:20:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里闻起来像死亡，\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells like death,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.12,1:20:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有鸟粪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bird shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.60,1:20:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.43,1:21:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.60,1:22:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不，不，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.90,1:22:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.90,1:22:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你，求你，该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.53,1:23:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.75,1:23:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gah! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.19,1:23:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.67,1:23:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃！呃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Egh! Guh!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.50,1:23:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.21,1:23:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uah!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.65,1:24:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当初要是把那男孩的头给我就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better you'd given me that boy's head when you had the offer.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.74,1:24:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你第二次可以救你那两面三刀的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's twice you might have saved your fork-tongued mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.54,1:24:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，但你很快就会在她身边了，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, but you'll be by her side soon enough,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.58,1:24:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地狱里吮吸那黑色的乳房\N{\fnArial\fs30}suckling that black teat in hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.11,1:24:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须死在这房子里来滋养下面的土地，\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must die in this house to feed the earth beneath,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.46,1:24:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,滋养这些山丘，\N{\fnArial\fs30}to feed these hills,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.81,1:24:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些活着的古老石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}these ancient stones that do live.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.73,1:24:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，魔鬼，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, devil,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.52,1:24:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有东西给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.35,1:24:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为科拉·费舍尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for Cora Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.05,1:24:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我噎死吧，\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go on and choke on it,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.35,1:24:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.71,1:25:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个恶魔，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this devil,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.41,1:25:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚弄自己以为自己是个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}fools himself into thinking he's a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.11,1:25:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的路和我的一样终将归于黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your road ends in the dark like mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.99,1:25:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个，\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.77,1:26:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫，\N{\fnArial\fs30}witch,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.95,1:26:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I ain't.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.08,1:26:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个都会被烧死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll burn, both of ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.08,1:26:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像科拉·费舍尔被烧死一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Cora Fisher burns.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.91,1:26:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你那女巫母亲被烧死一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like your witch mother burns.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.87,1:26:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.41,1:26:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是万灵节，不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all souls, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.03,1:26:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.77,1:26:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那是我的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that one's mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.16,1:26:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.21,1:26:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必你总有一天会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you'll find out someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.99,1:26:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我们所有人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.70,1:27:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么想的吗，汤姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I think, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.97,1:27:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你所谓的幸运骨头，\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that so-called lucky bone of yours,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.93,1:27:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得它只是一块猫骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's just a cat bone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.76,1:27:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直以来你以为它蕴含力量，但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this time you thought it held the power, but.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.85,1:27:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为力量其实在你体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the power was in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.94,1:27:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他害怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.73,1:27:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有理由害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was right to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.08,1:27:43.08,Title,0,0,0,0,,[歌曲：鲁文兄弟乐队的《罪人，你最好准备好》]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[song: 'Sinner You'd Better Get Ready' by The Louvin Brothers]
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.79,1:27:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 哦罪人你最好做好准备 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Oh sinner you better get ready ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.57,1:27:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 罪人必死的时刻即将来临 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ The time's a comin' when the sinner must die ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.19,1:27:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 哦上帝给诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Oh God gave Noah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.02,1:27:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈，我经历过更糟的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, I've woke up to worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.45,1:27:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间我变老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden I'm old.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.63,1:27:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.07,1:28:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该如何面对衰老\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to be old.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.77,1:28:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我留着这副旧马笼头是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I held on to this old bridle for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.56,1:28:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 唱着哈利路亚，罪人你最好做好准备 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Singing Halleluya, sinner you bet get ready ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.21,1:28:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 罪人必死的时刻即将来临 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ The time's a comin' when the sinner must die ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.22,1:28:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有女巫最后都落得同样的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}All us witches end up the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.44,1:28:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.01,1:28:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.54,1:28:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrgh!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.28,1:28:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,芭比·乔，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobbie Jo,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.11,1:28:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，醒醒乔，醒醒！ -\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, wake up Joe, wake up! -
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.02,1:28:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.50,1:28:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.99,1:28:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进入了隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went inside the tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.82,1:28:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.64,1:28:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该是聪明的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be the smart one.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.34,1:28:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.43,1:29:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.78,1:29:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把货物拿回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the cargo back.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.05,1:29:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错的实地工作，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice field work, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.36,1:29:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说，我在下面不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I wasn't down there by myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.53,1:29:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直和牧师在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with the Reverend the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.75,1:29:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他我绝对出不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never would have gotten out of there without him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.55,1:29:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及60年代的到来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait for the 60s.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.64,1:29:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,60年代，是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}60s, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.38,1:29:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是属于我的年代，芭比·乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't my decade, Bobbie Jo.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.03,1:29:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉好时光即将到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel good times are coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.91,1:29:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.69,1:29:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会太想念这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't gonna miss this place much.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.96,1:29:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.00,1:29:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等不及要回家把这一切都记录下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait to get home and just document all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.57,1:29:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个汤姆·法雷尔其实不坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Tom Ferrell's not a bad egg.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.83,1:29:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好你及时出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky you came along when you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.88,1:30:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是需要一点推动，仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just needed a little push, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.58,1:30:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.63,1:30:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,大个子，你什么都不怕，是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not afraid of anything, are you, big guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.85,1:30:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，长成这样也有好处，乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, there's an upside to looking like this, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.03,1:30:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看镜子里这张脸看得够久了，那些怪物就不那么可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see this face in the mirror long enough the monsters don't look too bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.90,1:30:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.90,1:30:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我知道有件事你是害怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know something you're afraid of, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.30,1:30:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.71,1:30:54.97,Title,0,0,0,0,,[歌曲：牛仔罗伊·布朗的《烦恼》]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[song: 'Trouble in Mind' by Cowboy Roy Brown]
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.76,1:30:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 忧心忡忡，\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Trouble in mind,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.25,1:31:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我很忧郁，是的 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I'm blue, yeah ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.47,1:31:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我不会一直忧郁，鲍勃会的 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I won't be blue always, Bob will ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.91,1:31:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 因为阳光终会照进 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Cause that sun is gonna shine ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.04,1:31:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我的后门 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ in my back door someday ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.17,1:31:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 希望很快，啊男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Hope soon and aha boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.43,1:31:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 忧心忡忡很忧郁 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Trouble in mind is blue ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.13,1:31:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我只看到我六月的障碍 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I just see me blockade June ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.06,1:31:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 当你看到我笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ When you see me laughin'
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.06,1:31:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我笑只是为了不哭 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I'm laughin' just to keep from cryin' ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.93,1:31:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 必须让我 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Gotta let me ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.68,1:31:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 忧心忡忡，我很忧郁\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Trouble in mind, I'm blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.77,1:31:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我不会一直忧郁，为什么？ ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ And I won't be blue all way, why? ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.56,1:31:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 因为阳光终会照进我的后门 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Because sun's gonna shine in my back door some day ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.47,1:31:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 要去河边\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Going down to the river.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.52,1:31:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 我要带上我的摇椅 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ And I'm going to take my rockin' chair ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.82,1:31:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 你要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ What you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.48,1:32:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪如果忧郁把我带走，我要离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ And if the blues take me I'm gonna rock away from here.
